1
00:00:00,760 --> 00:00:03,199
[♪♪♪]

2
00:00:03,199 --> 00:00:05,160
I'm Peppa Pig. Snort.

3
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:06,920
This is
my little brother George.

4
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:07,920
Oink, oink.

5
00:00:07,920 --> 00:00:10,280
This is Mummy Pig.
[SNORTS]

6
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:12,040
And this is Daddy Pig.

7
00:00:12,040 --> 00:00:13,280
[SNORTS]

8
00:00:13,280 --> 00:00:15,760
Peppa Pig. Snort.

9
00:00:15,760 --> 00:00:19,080
[♪♪♪]

10
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:22,279
PEPPA:
"The Tree House."

11
00:00:22,279 --> 00:00:25,640
NARRATOR:
Peppa and George are visiting
Granny Pig and Grandpa Pig.

12
00:00:25,640 --> 00:00:26,880
[KNOCKS]

13
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,240
Granny Pig.

14
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:29,320
Ganggy Ig.

15
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,119
Hello, my little ones.
Snort.

16
00:00:31,119 --> 00:00:32,720
Before you come
in the house,

17
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:35,000
you must take off
your muddy boots.

18
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:36,720
Yes, Granny.
Oink.

19
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,440
[BOTH GIGGLE]

20
00:00:40,360 --> 00:00:43,519
Peppa, George,
look what I've made.

21
00:00:43,519 --> 00:00:44,839
Little curtains.

22
00:00:44,839 --> 00:00:46,120
Ooh.
Ooh.

23
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:49,000
What are the little curtains
for, Granny?

24
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,440
It's a surprise. Snort.

25
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:53,080
Do you want to see what
Grandpa Pig has made for you

26
00:00:53,080 --> 00:00:54,239
in the garden?

27
00:00:54,239 --> 00:00:55,839
Yes, please.
Oink, oink.

28
00:00:55,839 --> 00:00:57,919
[GIGGLING]

29
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:03,239
Grandpa Pig.

30
00:01:03,239 --> 00:01:04,440
Baba Ig.

31
00:01:04,440 --> 00:01:06,960
Hello, Peppa, George.

32
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:09,560
Look what I've made
for you.

33
00:01:09,560 --> 00:01:11,360
Snort. A tree house.

34
00:01:11,360 --> 00:01:13,960
A tree house
for George and me?

35
00:01:13,960 --> 00:01:16,240
Hee-hee-hee.
Oink, oink.

36
00:01:16,240 --> 00:01:18,280
And the little curtains are

37
00:01:18,280 --> 00:01:20,840
for your tree house.

38
00:01:20,840 --> 00:01:22,320
Hooray!

39
00:01:22,320 --> 00:01:25,039
Peppa and George
love their tree house.

40
00:01:25,039 --> 00:01:28,000
Thank you, Granny Pig.
Thank you, Grandpa Pig.

41
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:29,440
Oink, oink.

42
00:01:29,440 --> 00:01:32,880
Ho-ho. Snort. Who wants
to go inside first?

43
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:34,280
Me! Me!

44
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:36,479
In you go, then.

45
00:01:36,479 --> 00:01:41,759
Before I go in my tree house,
I must take off my muddy boots.

46
00:01:43,640 --> 00:01:46,199
I'm in my tree house.

47
00:01:46,199 --> 00:01:48,240
[SING-SONG]
I'm in my tree house.

48
00:01:48,240 --> 00:01:49,679
[GIGGLES]

49
00:01:49,679 --> 00:01:50,759
Oink, oink.

50
00:01:50,759 --> 00:01:52,160
George,
would you like

51
00:01:52,160 --> 00:01:53,720
to go
in the tree house too?

52
00:01:53,720 --> 00:01:55,240
Oink, oink.

53
00:01:56,600 --> 00:01:58,399
Yes? Who is it?

54
00:01:58,399 --> 00:02:01,240
A young pig named George
would like to pay a visit.

55
00:02:01,240 --> 00:02:02,720
Snort. Can he come in?

56
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:05,520
As long as he takes off
his muddy boots.

57
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:07,520
George,
take your boots off,

58
00:02:07,520 --> 00:02:10,000
then you can visit Peppa
in the tree house.

59
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,239
[GIGGLES]

60
00:02:13,160 --> 00:02:14,760
[SING-SONG]
Who is it?

61
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,239
Oink.
George?

62
00:02:16,239 --> 00:02:17,480
Oink, oink.

63
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:21,239
[BOTH GIGGLE]

64
00:02:21,239 --> 00:02:23,320
Yes?
[SING-SONG] Who is it?

65
00:02:23,320 --> 00:02:24,680
Snort.
It's Mummy Pig.

66
00:02:24,680 --> 00:02:26,760
Have you room
for any more visitors?

67
00:02:26,760 --> 00:02:30,359
Hm. You have to say
the secret words.

68
00:02:30,359 --> 00:02:32,359
Then you can come
into our house.

69
00:02:32,359 --> 00:02:33,760
[GIGGLES]

70
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:36,680
I see. And what are
the secret words?

71
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:39,400
I have to whisper them
to you.

72
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:43,519
The secret words are
"Daddy's Big Tummy."

73
00:02:43,519 --> 00:02:45,280
I see. Ha-ha.

74
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:48,560
[BOTH GIGGLE]

75
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:50,840
Say the secret words.

76
00:02:50,840 --> 00:02:52,200
Daddy's Big Tummy.

77
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:55,720
That's right.
Daddy's Big Tummy.

78
00:02:55,720 --> 00:02:59,239
Snort. I think those
are silly secret words.

79
00:02:59,239 --> 00:03:00,920
[LAUGHING]

80
00:03:00,920 --> 00:03:04,320
Mummy, before you come
in our house,

81
00:03:04,320 --> 00:03:06,359
you must take off
your boots.

82
00:03:06,359 --> 00:03:07,640
Of course.

83
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:11,560
[GIGGLING]

84
00:03:11,560 --> 00:03:13,840
Snort. There's room
for Daddy too.

85
00:03:14,959 --> 00:03:17,000
Say the secret words,
Daddy.

86
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:20,600
Can I have different
secret words, please?

87
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:22,600
ALL: No.

88
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:24,480
Oh, all right.

89
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:26,880
Daddy's Big Tummy.

90
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:28,640
[LAUGH]

91
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:30,000
That's right.

92
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,880
You can come in now, Daddy.

93
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:34,920
Snort. Take your boots off.

94
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:37,200
[GRUNTS]

95
00:03:37,200 --> 00:03:40,519
Uh, I don't think I can fit
through the door.

96
00:03:40,519 --> 00:03:41,799
[GIGGLES]

97
00:03:41,799 --> 00:03:43,840
That's because your tummy's
too big.

98
00:03:43,840 --> 00:03:45,359
[LAUGH]
[LAUGH]

99
00:03:45,359 --> 00:03:47,040
Snort. I know.

100
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:50,280
Daddy Pig can climb in
through the top.

101
00:03:51,560 --> 00:03:53,760
Peppa, George,
Mummy Pig and Daddy Pig

102
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,799
are all in the tree house.

103
00:03:55,799 --> 00:03:57,399
[ALL LAUGH]

104
00:03:57,399 --> 00:04:02,359
Granny, I love our tree house.
I don't want to ever come out.

105
00:04:02,359 --> 00:04:03,959
That's nice, Peppa.

106
00:04:03,959 --> 00:04:07,000
But are you sure you don't want
to visit me in my house?

107
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,679
No, thank you, Granny.

108
00:04:09,679 --> 00:04:11,799
In that case,
Grandpa Pig and I

109
00:04:11,799 --> 00:04:13,920
will just have to eat
my homemade cookies

110
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:16,320
all by ourselves.

111
00:04:16,320 --> 00:04:19,039
Snort. Cookies!

112
00:04:19,039 --> 00:04:21,000
[GIGGLES]

113
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,520
Granny Pig.

114
00:04:23,520 --> 00:04:25,719
Here are
my homemade cookies.

115
00:04:25,719 --> 00:04:27,680
But if you want to come in,

116
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:29,719
you have to say
the secret words.

117
00:04:29,719 --> 00:04:31,039
That's easy.

118
00:04:31,039 --> 00:04:33,000
Daddy's Big Tummy.

119
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:34,400
That's right.

120
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:36,000
[ALL LAUGH]

121
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:39,800
Well, I still think that those
are very silly secret words.

122
00:04:39,800 --> 00:04:42,840
[ALL LAUGHING, SNORTING]

123
00:04:49,400 --> 00:04:51,919
PEPPA:
"Fancy Dress Party."

124
00:04:53,440 --> 00:04:56,680
Peppa and George are having
a fancy dress party.

125
00:04:56,680 --> 00:04:58,680
All their friends
are invited.

126
00:04:58,680 --> 00:05:01,280
Peppa is dressed
as a fairy princess.

127
00:05:01,280 --> 00:05:02,520
Snort.

128
00:05:02,520 --> 00:05:05,400
And George is dressed
as a dinosaur.

129
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:09,159
Grr! Dine-saur.
Hee-hee-hee.

130
00:05:09,159 --> 00:05:10,159
[HORN BEEPS]

131
00:05:10,159 --> 00:05:11,479
Here are Peppa's friends--

132
00:05:11,479 --> 00:05:13,760
Candy Cat, Suzy Sheep,
Danny Dog,

133
00:05:13,760 --> 00:05:16,120
Rebecca Rabbit
and Pedro Pony.

134
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,360
Baa.

135
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,280
Suzy is wearing
her nurse's costume.

136
00:05:19,280 --> 00:05:20,479
[DING-DONG]

137
00:05:20,479 --> 00:05:22,280
Snort.
Hello, Suzy.

138
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:24,960
Baa.
Hello, Mr. Pig.

139
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:26,760
I'm glad the nurse has arrived.

140
00:05:26,760 --> 00:05:28,560
Have you just come
from the hospital?

141
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:33,159
Uh, I'm not a real nurse.
It's just pretend.

142
00:05:33,159 --> 00:05:35,919
Ho-ho-ho. Very good.

143
00:05:35,919 --> 00:05:39,000
My, my.
Who have we here?

144
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:41,000
Woof, woof.
I'm a pirate.

145
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:43,520
Shiver me timbers.
Ha-ha-ha.

146
00:05:43,520 --> 00:05:47,440
Meow. I'm a witch.
I can turn you into a frog.

147
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:49,039
[NICKERS, NEIGHS]

148
00:05:49,039 --> 00:05:50,240
I'm a clown.

149
00:05:50,240 --> 00:05:51,719
[BEEPS]

150
00:05:51,719 --> 00:05:53,599
Ha-ha-ha.
That's funny.

151
00:05:53,599 --> 00:05:55,800
Snort. And what are you,
Rebecca Rabbit?

152
00:05:55,800 --> 00:05:58,280
I'm a carrot.
Ha-ha-ha-ha.

153
00:05:58,280 --> 00:06:00,240
Fantastic. Come in.

154
00:06:00,240 --> 00:06:02,359
There's a fairy princess
and a dinosaur waiting

155
00:06:02,359 --> 00:06:03,479
to meet you.

156
00:06:03,479 --> 00:06:04,520
[ALL GIGGLE]

157
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:06,320
Snort. Hello, everyone.

158
00:06:06,320 --> 00:06:08,840
ALL:
Hello, Peppa.

159
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:12,000
Hello, Suzy.
I'm Princess Peppa. Snort.

160
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:14,440
You must bow
when you speak to me.

161
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:16,760
Hello, Your Majesty. Baa.

162
00:06:16,760 --> 00:06:21,719
I'm Nurse Suzy.
Open wide and say ahh.

163
00:06:21,719 --> 00:06:23,320
Ahh.

164
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:25,120
[GIGGLE]

165
00:06:25,120 --> 00:06:27,359
Neigh. I'm a clown.

166
00:06:27,359 --> 00:06:28,799
Do something funny.

167
00:06:28,799 --> 00:06:31,039
[BEEP]
[GIGGLES]

168
00:06:31,039 --> 00:06:34,159
Woof. Rebecca, why are you
dressed as a carrot?

169
00:06:34,159 --> 00:06:35,919
I like carrots.

170
00:06:35,919 --> 00:06:37,120
[ALL LAUGH]

171
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:39,400
Grrr. Dine-saur.

172
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,520
[GASPS]

173
00:06:40,520 --> 00:06:42,400
A scary dinosaur.

174
00:06:42,400 --> 00:06:44,200
[ALL LAUGH]

175
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:46,599
Peppa is admiring herself
in the mirror.

176
00:06:46,599 --> 00:06:50,560
Mirror, mirror on the wall,
who's the fairest of them all?

177
00:06:50,560 --> 00:06:51,799
Snort.

178
00:06:51,799 --> 00:06:53,799
[GHOSTLY VOICE]
You are, Peppa.

179
00:06:53,799 --> 00:06:54,919
[GIGGLES]

180
00:06:54,919 --> 00:06:56,520
Meow. Hello, Peppa.

181
00:06:56,520 --> 00:07:00,080
[NORMAL VOICE]
Hello. I'm a little
fairy princess. Snort.

182
00:07:00,080 --> 00:07:01,919
I'm a witch. Meow.

183
00:07:01,919 --> 00:07:04,080
And I've got a magic wand.

184
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:06,120
I've got a magic wand too.

185
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:08,080
I can turn you into a frog.

186
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:10,919
And I'll turn you
into a frog.

187
00:07:10,919 --> 00:07:12,039
Aah!

188
00:07:12,039 --> 00:07:13,200
[BOTH GIGGLE]

189
00:07:13,200 --> 00:07:16,120
Dine-saur. Grrr!

190
00:07:16,120 --> 00:07:17,200
[GASPS]

191
00:07:17,200 --> 00:07:18,640
[CRYING]

192
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:21,799
Oh, dear, George is scared
of his own reflection.

193
00:07:21,799 --> 00:07:23,400
Oh, silly George.

194
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:25,440
Look, it's you
in the mirror.

195
00:07:25,440 --> 00:07:28,479
Hee-hee-hee. Grr.

196
00:07:28,479 --> 00:07:30,520
Children,
it's time to decide

197
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:33,599
who has the best
fancy dress costume.

198
00:07:33,599 --> 00:07:35,039
Snort.
We need a judge.

199
00:07:35,039 --> 00:07:36,359
Me.
Me.
Me.

200
00:07:36,359 --> 00:07:37,440
Ho-ho-ho.

201
00:07:37,440 --> 00:07:39,039
As it's Peppa's party,

202
00:07:39,039 --> 00:07:41,520
maybe she should be
the judge.
Snort.

203
00:07:41,520 --> 00:07:44,200
[SING-SONG]
I'm the judge.
I'm the judge.

204
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,760
Daddy, what is a judge?

205
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:47,880
The judge decides
who has the best costume.

206
00:07:47,880 --> 00:07:50,200
Snort. Oh, goody.

207
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:53,159
Peppa is going to choose
who has the best costume.

208
00:07:53,159 --> 00:07:56,599
Suzy, can I see
your costume, please?

209
00:07:56,599 --> 00:08:01,000
Baa. I'm Nurse Suzy.
I make people better.

210
00:08:01,000 --> 00:08:03,840
Very good, Nurse Suzy.
Snort. Now Danny.

211
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:07,640
Woof. I'm a pirate.
Shiver me timbers.

212
00:08:07,640 --> 00:08:10,359
Hee-hee-hee. Now Candy.

213
00:08:10,359 --> 00:08:12,280
Meow. I'm a witch.

214
00:08:12,280 --> 00:08:14,719
I can turn you
into a frog.

215
00:08:14,719 --> 00:08:17,799
Well, I'm a fairy princess,
and I can turn you into a frog.

216
00:08:17,799 --> 00:08:18,840
[SNORTS]

217
00:08:18,840 --> 00:08:20,239
Phbbt.
Phbbt.

218
00:08:20,239 --> 00:08:21,599
Children,
children.

219
00:08:21,599 --> 00:08:23,039
Sorry, Mummy.

220
00:08:23,039 --> 00:08:24,640
Who's next?
[HORN BEEPS]

221
00:08:24,640 --> 00:08:26,159
I'm a clown.

222
00:08:26,159 --> 00:08:28,679
[BEEPS]

223
00:08:28,679 --> 00:08:32,319
Hee-hee-hee. That's funny.
Snort. And Rebecca.

224
00:08:32,319 --> 00:08:34,880
I'm a carrot. Ha-ha-ha.

225
00:08:34,880 --> 00:08:36,319
Lovely.

226
00:08:36,319 --> 00:08:37,760
Oink.
[GIGGLES]

227
00:08:37,760 --> 00:08:41,439
And my little brother George
is a scary dinosaur.

228
00:08:41,439 --> 00:08:43,120
Grrr.

229
00:08:43,120 --> 00:08:45,640
Everyone's costume
is very good.

230
00:08:45,640 --> 00:08:48,160
ALL:
Hooray!

231
00:08:48,160 --> 00:08:49,760
Now you say
who the winner is.

232
00:08:49,760 --> 00:08:52,120
Oh, yes. Ahem.

233
00:08:52,120 --> 00:08:54,560
And the winner is...

234
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:55,840
Me.

235
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:57,520
[BOTH GASP]
[ALL GASP]

236
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,560
Peppa, you can't pick yourself.

237
00:08:59,560 --> 00:09:02,199
You're the judge.
Oh. Can't I?

238
00:09:02,199 --> 00:09:04,199
You have to pick
another winner.

239
00:09:04,199 --> 00:09:07,319
Okay. The carrot wins.

240
00:09:07,319 --> 00:09:08,400
CHILDREN:
Hooray!

241
00:09:08,400 --> 00:09:10,319
Thank you. Ha-ha-ha.

242
00:09:10,319 --> 00:09:12,439
Peppa loves
fancy dress parties.

243
00:09:12,439 --> 00:09:15,000
Everyone loves
fancy dress parties.

244
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,880
[ALL LAUGH]

245
00:09:21,360 --> 00:09:24,079
PEPPA:
"The Museum."

246
00:09:24,079 --> 00:09:27,280
Peppa and her family are going
to the museum.

247
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:29,560
[GEORGE AND PEPPA GIGGLE]

248
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:32,680
Snort. Daddy,
what is a museum?
Snort.

249
00:09:32,680 --> 00:09:34,800
It's a place full
of interesting things

250
00:09:34,800 --> 00:09:36,680
that are very old.

251
00:09:36,680 --> 00:09:38,199
Older than you?

252
00:09:38,199 --> 00:09:41,000
Yes, even older than me.

253
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,160
Ooh.
Ooooh.

254
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:43,959
Really old.

255
00:09:43,959 --> 00:09:45,280
[BOTH LAUGH]

256
00:09:45,280 --> 00:09:47,280
Snort. There's one room
full of things

257
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:49,880
that belonged to kings
and queens from long ago.

258
00:09:49,880 --> 00:09:53,079
I want to see
the king and queen's room.

259
00:09:53,079 --> 00:09:56,760
And there's another room
with a real dinosaur.

260
00:09:56,760 --> 00:10:01,120
Wow. Dine-saur. Grrr!

261
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:03,880
[ALL LAUGH]

262
00:10:03,880 --> 00:10:05,000
Hello, Mummy Pig.

263
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,000
Snort.
Hello, Miss Rabbit.

264
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,400
How many tickets,
please?

265
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:10,520
Two adults
and two children.

266
00:10:12,360 --> 00:10:15,280
Dine-saur. Grrr!

267
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:18,480
Ha-ha.
And a dinosaur.

268
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,920
[ALL LAUGH]

269
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:21,880
Peppa wants to see
the room full of things

270
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:24,199
that belong to kings and queens
from long ago.

271
00:10:24,199 --> 00:10:26,000
Wow.

272
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:27,760
Oink. Dine-saur?

273
00:10:27,760 --> 00:10:30,199
But George wants
to see the real dinosaur.

274
00:10:30,199 --> 00:10:31,400
[FUSSES]

275
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:33,720
Snort.
Don't worry, George.

276
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,720
We will see
the dinosaur next.

277
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:37,000
Oink, oink.

278
00:10:37,000 --> 00:10:38,959
Peppa,
these are all the things

279
00:10:38,959 --> 00:10:41,600
that the queen had
a long time ago.

280
00:10:41,600 --> 00:10:44,319
This is the queen's
special chair.

281
00:10:44,319 --> 00:10:46,319
It's called a throne.

282
00:10:46,319 --> 00:10:49,959
Snort. It's beautiful.

283
00:10:49,959 --> 00:10:51,920
This is the queen's dress.

284
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:55,560
Snort. It's so pretty.

285
00:10:55,560 --> 00:11:00,079
Look, Peppa. This is
the queen's golden crown.

286
00:11:00,079 --> 00:11:05,560
Wow! Snort.
What lovely things.

287
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:08,839
Mummy, where is
the queen's television?

288
00:11:08,839 --> 00:11:10,640
They didn't have
television then.

289
00:11:10,640 --> 00:11:12,560
Aah. No television?

290
00:11:12,560 --> 00:11:15,280
Snort.
But they did have computers?

291
00:11:15,280 --> 00:11:18,640
No, they didn't have
computers either.

292
00:11:18,640 --> 00:11:21,600
Snort.
What did they do all day?

293
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:23,120
[BOTH LAUGH]

294
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:26,160
Snort.
Mummy, if I was the queen,

295
00:11:26,160 --> 00:11:29,079
I would eat as much cake
as I wanted.

296
00:11:29,079 --> 00:11:31,360
Peppa imagines being a queen.

297
00:11:31,360 --> 00:11:34,000
[TRUMPET FANFARE PLAYING]

298
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:36,000
[GIGGLES]

299
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:38,400
[GOBBLES]

300
00:11:38,400 --> 00:11:40,719
Mmm, delicious.

301
00:11:40,719 --> 00:11:42,439
Is there anything else

302
00:11:42,439 --> 00:11:44,240
you would care for,
Queen Peppa?

303
00:11:44,240 --> 00:11:46,600
Yes.
More cake, please.

304
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,839
Of course.

305
00:11:47,839 --> 00:11:49,719
[GIGGLES, SNORTS]

306
00:11:49,719 --> 00:11:51,760
DADDY PIG [ECHOING]:
Come on, everyone.

307
00:11:51,760 --> 00:11:53,800
Coming, Daddy.

308
00:11:53,800 --> 00:11:55,240
[GIGGLES]

309
00:11:55,240 --> 00:11:57,839
Daddy, I'm Queen Peppa.

310
00:11:57,839 --> 00:12:00,240
You must bow
when you speak to me.

311
00:12:00,240 --> 00:12:04,520
Oh, I'm most terribly sorry,
Your Royal Highness.

312
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:06,120
And what do you do?

313
00:12:06,120 --> 00:12:07,680
I'm your daddy.

314
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:10,480
Hm, that must be
very interesting.

315
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:13,439
Yes, it's very interesting.

316
00:12:13,439 --> 00:12:15,280
And what room is this?

317
00:12:15,280 --> 00:12:18,319
This is the dinosaur room.

318
00:12:18,319 --> 00:12:20,079
Snort! The dinosaur room?

319
00:12:20,079 --> 00:12:22,920
George, this is
the dinosaur room.

320
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:26,319
Hee-hee-hee. Dine-saur.

321
00:12:26,319 --> 00:12:28,600
Where is the dinosaur?

322
00:12:28,600 --> 00:12:30,240
He's somewhere in the room.

323
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:33,680
I can't see him.
He must be very small.

324
00:12:33,680 --> 00:12:35,000
Oink.

325
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,719
DADDY PIG:
Actually, Peppa,
he's very big.

326
00:12:37,719 --> 00:12:38,839
[GASPS]

327
00:12:40,599 --> 00:12:41,880
Wow.

328
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:46,160
These are the bones
of a real dinosaur.

329
00:12:46,160 --> 00:12:49,800
Hee-hee-hee.
Oink. Dine-saur.

330
00:12:49,800 --> 00:12:51,280
[ECHOES] Grr!

331
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:53,199
[GEORGE AND PEPPA GIGGLE]

332
00:12:53,199 --> 00:12:57,079
George imagines
being a big dinosaur.

333
00:12:58,480 --> 00:13:01,160
Snort. Rrawrr!

334
00:13:01,160 --> 00:13:02,360
Aah!

335
00:13:02,360 --> 00:13:03,800
Rrawrr-awrr!

336
00:13:03,800 --> 00:13:07,680
It's a dinosaur!
Help! Help!

337
00:13:07,680 --> 00:13:10,000
Rrawrr-awrr!

338
00:13:10,000 --> 00:13:11,719
Rrawrr-awrr!

339
00:13:11,719 --> 00:13:13,319
[BOTH GIGGLE]

340
00:13:13,319 --> 00:13:17,319
Ha-ha. The dinosaur room
is George's favorite room.

341
00:13:17,319 --> 00:13:19,160
Oink. Hee-hee-hee.

342
00:13:19,160 --> 00:13:23,719
My favorite room is
the king and queen's room.

343
00:13:23,719 --> 00:13:25,680
And it looks as if Daddy Pig

344
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:27,520
is already
in his favorite room.

345
00:13:27,520 --> 00:13:29,520
Which room is that,
Mummy?

346
00:13:29,520 --> 00:13:31,400
The room
with the cakes in.

347
00:13:31,400 --> 00:13:34,719
Daddy Pig's favorite room
is the museum café.

348
00:13:34,719 --> 00:13:36,680
[LAUGH]

349
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:39,319
Snort.
Come on, tuck in.

350
00:13:39,319 --> 00:13:41,560
Oh, yes. Snort.

351
00:13:41,560 --> 00:13:43,520
This is
a very nice room.

352
00:13:43,520 --> 00:13:45,599
[ALL LAUGHING]

353
00:13:48,760 --> 00:13:51,680
[♪♪♪]

354
00:13:51,680 --> 00:13:54,560
PEPPA:
"Very Hot Day."

355
00:13:54,560 --> 00:13:58,360
The sun is shining.
It is a very hot day.

356
00:13:58,360 --> 00:14:00,760
Snort.
What a lovely hot day.

357
00:14:00,760 --> 00:14:02,199
[GIGGLING]

358
00:14:02,199 --> 00:14:04,280
Peppa and George
are wearing their boots.

359
00:14:04,280 --> 00:14:06,400
They are going to jump
in muddy puddles.

360
00:14:06,400 --> 00:14:09,120
I love muddy puddles.

361
00:14:09,120 --> 00:14:10,160
Oh.

362
00:14:10,160 --> 00:14:11,719
Oh, dear.

363
00:14:11,719 --> 00:14:14,719
The sun is so hot
that the puddles have dried up.

364
00:14:14,719 --> 00:14:17,880
Mummy, Daddy,
the puddles are all dry

365
00:14:17,880 --> 00:14:19,920
and we can't jump
in them.

366
00:14:19,920 --> 00:14:21,560
Never mind, Peppa.

367
00:14:21,560 --> 00:14:25,319
It's so sunny, you can play
in the paddling pool instead.

368
00:14:25,319 --> 00:14:27,959
Yes, the paddling pool!
Oink, oink.

369
00:14:27,959 --> 00:14:31,079
MUMMY PIG:
First you have to change
into your swimming costumes.

370
00:14:31,079 --> 00:14:32,680
Yes, Mummy.

371
00:14:32,680 --> 00:14:35,760
[ALL LAUGH]

372
00:14:37,719 --> 00:14:40,599
Peppa and George are wearing
their swimming costumes.

373
00:14:40,599 --> 00:14:43,040
Mummy Pig is wearing
her swimming costume

374
00:14:43,040 --> 00:14:45,880
and Daddy Pig is wearing
his swimming costume.

375
00:14:45,880 --> 00:14:52,319
Snort. Because it's so hot,
you need sun cream.

376
00:14:52,319 --> 00:14:53,599
Yuck!

377
00:14:53,599 --> 00:14:56,319
It's all oily and yucky.

378
00:14:59,040 --> 00:15:00,199
Yuck.

379
00:15:00,199 --> 00:15:03,479
Oh-ho-ho,
what a fuss about nothing.

380
00:15:03,479 --> 00:15:06,839
Yes, we all need sun cream
today.

381
00:15:06,839 --> 00:15:09,880
Oh. Hee-hee-hee-hee-hee.

382
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:14,040
Ho-ho. Snort.
Come on, George.

383
00:15:14,040 --> 00:15:15,719
Oink, oink.
Hee-hee-hee.

384
00:15:15,719 --> 00:15:19,199
Let's get some air
into this paddling pool.

385
00:15:19,199 --> 00:15:22,400
Daddy Pig is pumping up
the paddling pool.

386
00:15:24,640 --> 00:15:25,800
Oof.

387
00:15:25,800 --> 00:15:27,959
Easy as pie.

388
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:32,280
[GIGGLES, SNORTS]

389
00:15:32,280 --> 00:15:33,719
[GIGGLES]

390
00:15:33,719 --> 00:15:35,479
Peppa holds the hose

391
00:15:35,479 --> 00:15:38,360
and Mummy Pig
turns on the water.

392
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:39,920
[GURGLING]

393
00:15:39,920 --> 00:15:42,280
Snort. Where's the water?

394
00:15:43,880 --> 00:15:46,400
Whaaa!

395
00:15:46,400 --> 00:15:48,160
[GIGGLES]

396
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:51,199
[GEORGE AND PEPPA GIGGLING]

397
00:15:55,839 --> 00:15:58,800
Peppa and George
love their paddling pool.

398
00:15:58,800 --> 00:16:00,160
[BICYCLE BELL RINGS]

399
00:16:00,160 --> 00:16:01,760
WOMAN:
Ice cream! Ice cream!

400
00:16:01,760 --> 00:16:05,199
Miss Rabbit,
the ice cream lady. Snort!

401
00:16:05,199 --> 00:16:06,240
[RINGS BELL]

402
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,719
Ice cream!

403
00:16:07,719 --> 00:16:10,520
On very hot days,
Miss Rabbit sells ice cream.

404
00:16:10,520 --> 00:16:12,000
Mummy, Daddy?
Snort.

405
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:14,120
Can George and I
have an ice cream, please?

406
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:17,800
Oh, well, I suppose it is
an especially hot day.

407
00:16:17,800 --> 00:16:19,280
Hooray!

408
00:16:19,280 --> 00:16:21,319
Please,
can I have one as well?

409
00:16:21,319 --> 00:16:23,479
Everyone likes ice cream.

410
00:16:23,479 --> 00:16:25,479
Hello, Mummy Pig,
Peppa and George.

411
00:16:25,479 --> 00:16:27,120
Hello, Miss Rabbit.
Snort.

412
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:28,920
What ice creams
would you like?

413
00:16:28,920 --> 00:16:31,520
Can I have a cone, please,
Miss Rabbit?

414
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:33,199
Of course you may,
Peppa.

415
00:16:33,199 --> 00:16:34,560
Thank you.

416
00:16:34,560 --> 00:16:35,959
Snort.
The same for me.

417
00:16:35,959 --> 00:16:38,560
And one for Daddy Pig,
please.

418
00:16:38,560 --> 00:16:41,439
And what would
young Mr. George like?

419
00:16:41,439 --> 00:16:42,839
Dine-saur.

420
00:16:42,839 --> 00:16:44,359
A dinosaur?

421
00:16:44,359 --> 00:16:46,120
Silly George.

422
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:49,800
He always says "dinosaur"
for everything.

423
00:16:49,800 --> 00:16:51,760
Well, it just so happens

424
00:16:51,760 --> 00:16:54,959
that I do have
a dinosaur-shaped ice-lolly.

425
00:16:54,959 --> 00:16:56,359
[GIGGLES]

426
00:16:56,359 --> 00:16:58,920
Dine-saur. Grrr!

427
00:16:58,920 --> 00:17:01,000
George, you should eat
your ice-lolly

428
00:17:01,000 --> 00:17:02,560
before it melts.

429
00:17:02,560 --> 00:17:03,959
Dine-saur.

430
00:17:03,959 --> 00:17:06,240
George loves
his dinosaur ice-lolly so much,

431
00:17:06,240 --> 00:17:08,280
he doesn't want to eat it.

432
00:17:08,280 --> 00:17:09,720
Thank you, Miss Rabbit.

433
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:11,040
Enjoy the weather.

434
00:17:11,040 --> 00:17:13,159
[RINGS BELL]
[GIGGLE]

435
00:17:13,159 --> 00:17:15,720
George, I really think
you should eat your ice-lolly

436
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:17,960
before it melts and...

437
00:17:17,960 --> 00:17:20,280
falls on the ground.
Waaaah!

438
00:17:20,280 --> 00:17:23,280
Oh, dear, George's dinosaur
ice-lolly has melted

439
00:17:23,280 --> 00:17:25,359
and fallen on the ground.

440
00:17:25,359 --> 00:17:26,760
Never mind, George.

441
00:17:26,760 --> 00:17:28,800
You can share
Daddy's ice cream.

442
00:17:28,800 --> 00:17:30,560
I'm sure he won't mind.

443
00:17:30,560 --> 00:17:32,639
[GIGGLES]

444
00:17:32,639 --> 00:17:34,000
[SNORING]

445
00:17:34,000 --> 00:17:36,919
It is so warm,
Daddy Pig has fallen asleep.

446
00:17:36,919 --> 00:17:39,040
Snort.
Daddy Pig does look hot.

447
00:17:39,040 --> 00:17:42,040
Let's tip water on Daddy
to cool him down.

448
00:17:42,040 --> 00:17:44,320
Good idea, Peppa.

449
00:17:44,320 --> 00:17:45,639
Whoa! Snort.

450
00:17:45,639 --> 00:17:46,800
What happened?

451
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:49,000
You were all red and hot,
Daddy Pig.

452
00:17:49,000 --> 00:17:51,440
So we tipped water on you.

453
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:53,960
Oh, I see.
Thank you, Peppa.

454
00:17:55,840 --> 00:17:57,560
[LAUGH]

455
00:17:57,560 --> 00:18:00,480
Snort.
Look, the puddles are back!

456
00:18:00,480 --> 00:18:02,480
Quick, George,
let's get our boots.

457
00:18:02,480 --> 00:18:03,680
Oink, oink.

458
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:06,720
[GIGGLING]

459
00:18:06,720 --> 00:18:09,520
Peppa and George
are wearing their boots.

460
00:18:09,520 --> 00:18:10,760
[GIGGLING]

461
00:18:10,760 --> 00:18:13,080
Peppa and George
love the hot day,

462
00:18:13,080 --> 00:18:16,760
but most of all, they love
jumping up and down in puddles.

463
00:18:16,760 --> 00:18:18,879
Oh, ho-ho-ho.
Ha-ha-ha-ha-ha.

464
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:22,080
[♪♪♪]

465
00:18:22,080 --> 00:18:23,879
PEPPA:
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

466
00:18:23,879 --> 00:18:26,960
[SNORTS, GIGGLES]

467
00:18:26,960 --> 00:18:28,440
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

468
00:18:28,440 --> 00:18:29,480
GEORGE:
Oink, oink.

469
00:18:29,480 --> 00:18:30,560
[BOTH GIGGLE]

470
00:18:30,560 --> 00:18:32,879
♪ Peppa Pig ♪

471
00:18:32,879 --> 00:18:34,520
[SNORTS]

